    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163540/extras/e98cf77662bfb65596f475688637d296.webp?t=1742203151\" width=639 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As Redsky's first game, Whorehouse Manager is the ultimate brothel game combining both chibi style and anime style. With everything fully animated and a smooth, easy-to-use interface, it gives players the best experience and promising content!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By progressing, you unlock <strong>new girls, poses, customers, gallery gifs, stages, breeding scenes, full scale scenes, monster girls, cow girls </strong>and more.<i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a gif animated gallery for each girl, locked behind gameplay achievements and in game currency. <i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can call any girl to your office and have some interactions with \u2018em.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Current version features:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enjoy a total of 3 stages, 8 girls, 1 breeding scene, 5 full scale scenes, 8 poses and 60 gallery gifs!</i></p>",
